id: pm-dj98
title: "Capability: Concurrency & multi-agent safety"
description: "Groups the multi-agent concurrency-safety backlog surfaced by the 2026-07-03 concurrency review (integrity solid under parallel stress; five race/atomicity gaps filed). pm is agent-first: many agents mutate one git-backed workspace concurrently, so locking, claim semantics, and singleton-file writes must be safe by construction. Philosophy: project management = context management — concurrent context must never be silently lost."
