estimated_minutes: 720
acceptance_criteria: "All findings from the 2026-07-03 concurrency review are resolved or explicitly waived: atomic claim test-and-set, bounded lock-wait retry, singleton-file locking, ID-allocation TOCTOU guard, stale-lock takeover race. Parallel multi-agent stress (mutations, claims, config writes) preserves item and history integrity with zero silent lost updates."
